---
/**
 * The dissolve. The page brightens from the dark field of the science into the
 * clinical light of the author and the conversion path — chaos to creation
 * expressed as the site's own light progression.
 *
 * The text sits in the upper, still-dark portion of the gradient so contrast
 * holds; the lower half carries no content and simply resolves into the light
 * register that follows.
 */
---

<section class="register-dissolve">
  <div class="shell pb-40 pt-28 lg:pb-56 lg:pt-36">
    <!-- Measure is set in rem, not ch: `ch` resolves against this element's own
         1rem font-size rather than the display size of the quote inside it. -->
    <figure class="mx-auto max-w-[44rem] text-center">
      <p class="label text-lumen/70">The argument</p>
      <blockquote class="mt-7">
        <p class="text-h2 font-display text-field">
          Darwin asked how life began. This asks where it is going &mdash; and
          whether its duration is fixed.
        </p>
      </blockquote>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
